CHAPTER.VERS:
Judah was the father of Perez and Zerah 

          Tamar was their mother
        ; Perez was the father of Hezron; Hezron was the father of Ram;

Salmon was the father of Boaz
Rahab was his mother ; Boaz was the father of Obed
Ruth was his mother ;

Jesse was the father of David the King. David was the father of Solomon 

          his mother had been Uriah's wife
        ;
